</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 1:59 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->ok, thank you for the imput, this is a big part of my life, not posting on BTK.com but helping victims of unsolved crimes. And researching serial killers. So everyone is allowed to have an opinion, thank you for yours Nancy, if you don&#39;t want to help, That&#39;s ok with us. <BR>TopSail I agree with you, that isnt whats bothering me, it&#39;s how Rader could be in two places at once. And if he didn&#39;t kill these other people then who did?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
