<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST9973"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nancydrew<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nancydrew<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 2:10 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Embersage:  I&#39;m sorry if my reply was insulting.  Your efforts in  helping victims of unsolved crimes is noble and commendable. My point is only that LE seems to have this one pretty well in hand, and looking for an accomplice seems like a fishing expedition.  So, let&#39;s get to the next cold case!  I look forward to your input on whatever case piques the group&#39;s interest next!<!--/Text--></td></tr>
