</a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Embersage<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->2-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, March 01, 2005 - 6:29 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->No problem, we started this thread for ourselves, to put the timeline together, Tom started this site to catch BTK those of us here. May or may not have made a difference in the case. The one thing we did do was make a difference in each other&#39;s lives. Anytime things like this happen, poeple need to talk about it, pick it apart, to understand how and why, these monsters exist in society, each one on us feels a little more in control of our own safety, if we feel we are contributing in some way, That is why we are all still here, and I am happy to say I have met a great bunch of people on here.    <BR>Back to work, someone ask if we had an updated map,of known murders. anyone?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
