een; found 2 weeks later; died of drowning and exposure, body dumped in creek under bridge <BR>|- 12/08: Nancy Fox &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; bound and strangled, driver&#39;s license stolen &#40;later contained in BTK 2004 Murdock Park message drop&#41;, home invasion <BR>|- 12/08: BTK calls emergency hotline from payphone to report the Fox murder, a recording &#40;almost certainly edited&#41; of the call &#40;listen at catchbtk.com &#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/btk.wav</a>&#62;&#41; is later released by WPD <BR>1975&#42; <BR>|- 6/9: Carol Marsteller &#40;Sedgwick County/Wichita, KS&#41;; stabbed, body dumped... UPDATE 2/23/05: David Packard convicted &#60;<a href="http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id=15497" target=_top>http://www.dc.state.ks.us/kasper2/offender.asp?id= 15497</a>&#62; of Marstellar murder in 3/1987, paroled 3/2004 [more at KAKE tv] &#60;<a href="http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html" target=_top>http://www.kake.com/news/headlines/515277.html</a>&#62; [more at catchbtk.com] &#60;&#60;<a href="http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html?1109184392" target=_top>http://www.catchbtk.com/discus/messages/8/85.html? 1109184392</a>&#62;&#62; <BR>His son is born on July 27, 1975.  <BR>1974&#42; <BR>01/15: Joseph, Julie, Josephine, &amp; Joseph Jr. &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; strangled, telco cut, some bodies hooded, Otero car moved/abandoned, items taken, home invasion, children murdered <BR>|- 1/21: Bruce Douglas &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; body found; asphyxiated and enclosed in trunk of car in rural area N.E. of Wichita, WSU student, car abandoned, car left running, LE ruled &#34;accidental suicide&#34; [more] &#60;<a href="http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag=kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1" target=_top>http://forums.prospero.com/n/mb/message.asp?webtag =kr-kansas_news&amp;msg=5105.1</a>&#62; <BR>|- 4/4: Kathryn Bright &#40;Wichita, KS&#41; strangled &amp; stabbed to death, Kevin